  dialogueLines:
  - Four coppers. Three if you make me haggle. I'm counting either way.
  - I buy odd and sell odder. That rope? Spoken for. Some sellsword's runner is meant
    to collect it.
  - Poll says I'm over the line. I measured. She's under it.
